From 10abc54003077afb8ae9960f184327e8e91c40f1 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: daveey <daveey@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 21:17:13 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] [daveey] Preserve outcome and notice custody after proven
 supersession

Problem: the hub audit chat remained unresolved{notice_tail} after the
notice guarantee stamped its last blocked notice superseded and refreshed.
An older creator-decision notice was immediately behind it.

Why 1: outcome derivation did not recognize guarantee settlement, so its
successful refresh persisted notice_tail again.
Why 2: discovery selected the physical last row and excluded its final stamp,
stranding an older unanswered notice behind that row.
Why 3: creator-decision retirement lacked current local event/park proof;
scheduled alone does not distinguish a chat wait from a CI wait.
Root (happened): settlement producer and projection/discovery disagreed.
Root (not caught): tests checked stamp/no wake instead of immediate persisted
outcome, consecutive notices and mixed-content preservation.
Recurrence: stale-decision suppression already stamped/refreshed notices but
did not settle outcome projection or preserve earlier custody.

Share a content-bound whole-row receipt between projection and discovery.
Mint it only after exact local source rendering covers all content and current
task/park proof establishes settlement. Legacy superseded stamps require the
same conservative proof before lazy upgrade. Mixed batches, replay wrappers,
folded unrelated text, foreign/unprovable sources stay visible; appending text
invalidates a receipt. Bound exceptional history lookup to the existing tail
window and stop at real turn/unsettled boundaries. Require non-chat parks after
the creator decision. Optional source failures fail closed without finalizing
retry custody. Do not manufacture chat turns or force outcomes.

Proof:
- Original RED: four failures before edits; revised regression suite 67 passed.
- Direct consumers: 46 files, 1256 passed; split-module scanner 3 passed.
- Mutation v2: 18/18 killed across history/projection and whole-row proof;
  baselines 39 and 28 passed; all four sources restored byte-exact to archive.
- scripts/check: all 21 checks passed on final source.
- Read-only hub replay: 12 stores, 39 relevant rows, 8 legacy stamps not
  automatically transparent; 11 provable upgrades (8 creator, 3 blocked),
  0 already transparent, 0 current tail changes. Unprovable rows stay visible.
- Original chat naturally got a genuine assistant reply at 20:16Z before this
  unpublished fix and subsequently waited on real review. No injected turn,
  transcript edit or post-change live recovery is claimed from that event.
